mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CBD5E1 .75pt;padding:0cm 0cm 2.0pt 0cm'>

<h2><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;mso-fareas=
t-font-family:
"Times New Roman";mso-ansi-language:ES'>1.1. Inicio y Configuraci=C3=B3n
Parametrizada (RF1)<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

</div>

<p><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-=
serif;
color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>Al abrir </span><code><span lang=3DES
style=3D'font-size:9.5pt;color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>SistemaLogis=
ticaAuditoria.exe</span></code><span
lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;col=
or:#1E293B;
mso-ansi-language:ES'>, la aplicaci=C3=B3n lee autom=C3=A1ticamente el ar=
chivo local </span><span
class=3DSpellE><span class=3DGramE><code><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-si=
ze:9.5pt;
color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>appsettings.json</span></code></span>=
</span><span
lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;col=
or:#1E293B;
mso-ansi-language:ES'> para configurar las tarifas de negocio (precio bas=
e por
kilogramo =3D </span><code><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:9.5pt;color=
:#1E293B;
mso-ansi-language:ES'>$25.00</span></code><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-s=
ize:10.5pt;
font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>, t=
asa de
IVA =3D </span><code><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:9.5pt;color:#1E29=
3B;
mso-ansi-language:ES'>16%</span></code><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-size=
:10.5pt;
font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>, c=
osto
fijo de env=C3=ADo =3D </span><code><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:9.=
5pt;color:#1E293B;
mso-ansi-language:ES'>$60.00</span></code><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-s=
ize:10.5pt;
font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>,
penalizaci=C3=B3n por sobrepeso mayor a </span><code><span lang=3DES styl=
e=3D'font-size:
9.5pt;color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>20 kg</span></code><span lang=
=3DES
style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#1E293B=
;
mso-ansi-language:ES'> =3D </span><code><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-siz=
e:9.5pt;
color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>25%</span></code><span lang=3DES
style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#1E293B=
;
mso-ansi-language:ES'> y seguro obligatorio para valor declarado mayor a =
</span><code><span
lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:9.5pt;color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>$1=
,000.00</span></code><span
lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;col=
or:#1E293B;
mso-ansi-language:ES'> =3D </span><code><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-siz=
e:9.5pt;
color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>2%</span></code><span lang=3DES
style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#1E293B=
;
mso-ansi-language:ES'>). Si el archivo no existe, el sistema informa al
operador y genera la configuraci=C3=B3n por defecto sin interrumpir la ej=
ecuci=C3=B3n.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<div style=3D'mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid=
 #CBD5E1 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CBD5E1 .75pt;padding:0cm 0cm 2.0pt 0cm'>

<h2><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;mso-fareas=
t-font-family:
"Times New Roman";mso-ansi-language:ES'>1.2. Cambio Din=C3=A1mico Multi-I=
dioma
mediante JSON (<span class=3DGramE>Espa=C3=B1ol</span>, English, <span cl=
ass=3DSpellE>Fran=C3=A7ais</span>,
Deutsch, <span class=3DSpellE>Portugu=C3=AAs</span> - RF2)<o:p></o:p></sp=
an></h2>

</div>

<p><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-=
serif;
color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>En la esquina superior derecha se enc=
uentra
el selector de idioma cargado din=C3=A1micamente desde </span><code><span=
 lang=3DES
style=3D'font-size:9.5pt;color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>Recursos\<sp=
an
class=3DSpellE>etiquetas.json</span></span></code><span lang=3DES style=
=3D'font-size:
10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:=
ES'>
mediante la clase </span><span class=3DSpellE><code><span lang=3DES
style=3D'font-size:9.5pt;color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>Etiquetas.cs=
</span></code></span><span
lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;col=
or:#1E293B;
mso-ansi-language:ES'> y </span><span class=3DSpellE><code><span lang=3DE=
S
style=3D'font-size:9.5pt;color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>JsonSerializ=
er.Deserialize</span></code></span><code><span
lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:9.5pt;color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>&l=
t;List&lt;Etiquetas&gt;&gt;</span></code><span
lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;col=
or:#1E293B;
mso-ansi-language:ES'> (</span><span class=3DGramE><code><span lang=3DES
style=3D'font-size:9.5pt;color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>Espa=C3=B1ol=
</span></code></span><span
lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;col=
or:#1E293B;
mso-ansi-language:ES'>, </span><code><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:9=
.5pt;
color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>English</span></code><span lang=3DES
style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#1E293B=
;
mso-ansi-language:ES'>, </span><span class=3DSpellE><code><span lang=3DES
style=3D'font-size:9.5pt;color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>Fran=C3=A7ai=
s</span></code></span><span
lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;col=
or:#1E293B;
mso-ansi-language:ES'>, </span><code><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:9=
.5pt;
color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>Deutsch</span></code><span lang=3DES
style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#1E293B=
;
mso-ansi-language:ES'> y </span><span class=3DSpellE><code><span lang=3DE=
S
style=3D'font-size:9.5pt;color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>Portugu=C3=
=AAs</span></code></span><span
lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;col=
or:#1E293B;
mso-ansi-language:ES'>). Al cambiar la selecci=C3=B3n, todas las etiqueta=
s, botones,
