 de di=C3=A1logo
se traducen en tiempo real.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<div style=3D'mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid=
 #CBD5E1 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CBD5E1 .75pt;padding:0cm 0cm 2.0pt 0cm'>

<h2><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;mso-fareas=
t-font-family:
"Times New Roman";mso-ansi-language:ES'>1.3. Captura, Procesamiento de Lo=
tes e
Inspecci=C3=B3n Visual (RF3, RF4, RF5)<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

</div>

<ol start=3D1 type=3D1>
 <li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'color:#1E293B;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso=
-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt'><span lang=3DES
     style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;mso-fare=
ast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman";mso-ansi-language:ES'>Ingrese o pegue el lote de
     paquetes en la caja de texto multil=C3=ADnea usando el formato </spa=
n><span
     class=3DSpellE><span class=3DGramE><code><span lang=3DES style=3D'fo=
nt-size:9.5pt;
     mso-ansi-language:ES'>CODIGO;Cliente</span></code></span><code><span
     lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:9.5pt;mso-ansi-language:ES'>;<span clas=
s=3DGramE>Zona;PesoKg</span>;ValorDeclarado</span></code></span><span
     lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-seri=
f;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-ansi-language:ES'> (o
     presione <strong><span style=3D'font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif'>C=
argar
     Lote de Prueba</span></strong>).<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'color:#1E293B;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso=
-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt'><span lang=3DES
     style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;mso-fare=
ast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman";mso-ansi-language:ES'>Haga clic en <strong><span
     style=3D'font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif'>Procesar Lote y Guardar =
en BD</span></strong>.
     El sistema valida cada l=C3=ADnea, descarta las l=C3=ADneas corrupta=
s mostr=C3=A1ndolas
     en el listado inferior de errores (<strong><span style=3D'font-famil=
y:"Segoe UI",sans-serif'>Reto
     1</span></strong>), redimensiona din=C3=A1micamente el arreglo nativ=
o </span><span
     class=3DGramE><code><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:9.5pt;mso-ans=
i-language:
     ES'>Paquete[</span></code></span><code><span lang=3DES style=3D'font=
-size:
     9.5pt;mso-ansi-language:ES'>]</span></code><span lang=3DES style=3D'=
font-size:
     10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Ti=
mes New Roman";
     mso-ansi-language:ES'> desde capacidad 5 a 10 y ordena de mayor a me=
nor
     costo total mediante el algoritmo de la Burbuja (<strong><span
     style=3D'font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif'>Reto 2</span></strong>).=
<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'color:#1E293B;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso=
-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt'><span lang=3DES
     style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;mso-fare=
ast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman";mso-ansi-language:ES'>Haga clic sobre cualquier fi=
la de
     la tabla para inspeccionar su desglose financiero paso a paso en el =
<strong><span
     style=3D'font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif'>Panel Lateral de Inspecc=
i=C3=B3n
     (RF5)</span></strong>.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class=3DMsoNormal style=3D'color:#1E293B;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso=
-margin-bottom-alt:
     auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt'><span lang=3DES
     style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;mso-fare=
ast-font-family:
     "Times New Roman";mso-ansi-language:ES'>Use el bot=C3=B3n <strong><s=
pan
     style=3D'font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif'>Registrar Recepci=C3=B3n=
 (BD)</span></strong>
     para actualizar el estado del paquete a </span><code><span lang=3DES
     style=3D'font-size:9.5pt;mso-ansi-language:ES'>RECIBIDO EN DESTINO</=
span></code><span
     lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-seri=
f;
     mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-ansi-language:ES'> en =
la
     base de datos SQLite, o <strong><span style=3D'font-family:"Segoe UI=
",sans-serif'>Exportar
     a CSV (RF6)</span></strong> para guardar el reporte en disco mediant=
e </span><span
     class=3DSpellE><code><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:9.5pt;mso-an=
si-language:
     ES'>SaveFileDialog</span></code></span><span lang=3DES style=3D'font=
-size:
     10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:"Ti=
mes New Roman";
     mso-ansi-language:ES'>.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ol>

