<h2><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-serif;mso-fareas=
t-font-family:
"Times New Roman";mso-ansi-language:ES'>2.3. Instalaci=C3=B3n, Mantenimie=
nto y
Comandos de Repositorio (Git / GitHub)<o:p></o:p></span></h2>

</div>

<p><span lang=3DES style=3D'font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Segoe UI",sans-=
serif;
color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>Para clonar, compilar o ejecutar el
proyecto desde el repositorio oficial en GitHub:<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<div style=3D'mso-element:para-border-div;border:solid #CBD5E1 1.0pt;mso-=
border-alt:
solid #CBD5E1 .75pt;padding:7.0pt 7.0pt 7.0pt 7.0pt;background:#F1F5F9'><=
pre><span
lang=3DES style=3D'color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p><=
/span></pre><pre><span
lang=3DES style=3D'color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'># Clonar el reposi=
torio desde GitHub:<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span
lang=3DEN-US style=3D'color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>git clone ht=
tps://github.com/GZLR121/Miniproyecto2_CSharp.git<o:p></o:p></span></pre>=
<pre><span
lang=3DES style=3D'color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'>cd Miniproyecto2_C=
Sharp<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span
lang=3DES style=3D'color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p><=
/span></pre><pre><span
lang=3DES style=3D'color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'># Compilar y ejecu=
tar en .NET 8.0:<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span
class=3DSpellE><span lang=3DES style=3D'color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:E=
S'>dotnet</span></span><span
lang=3DES style=3D'color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'> <span class=3DSpe=
llE>build</span> <span
class=3DSpellE>SistemaLogisticaAuditoria</span>/<span class=3DSpellE>Sist=
emaLogisticaAuditoria.csproj</span><o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span
class=3DSpellE><span lang=3DES style=3D'color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:E=
S'>dotnet</span></span><span
lang=3DES style=3D'color:#1E293B;mso-ansi-language:ES'> run --<span class=
=3DSpellE>project</span> <span
class=3DSpellE>SistemaLogisticaAuditoria</span>/<span class=3DSpellE>Sist=
emaLogisticaAuditoria.csproj</span><o:p></o:p></span></pre></div>

